OL,3,AWhite House rolling out red carpet for
OL,4,Ahistoric Xi Jinping visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdding to the high-stakes state visit,
OL,7,Fa US-China trade agreement reached last
OL,8,Fyear is set to expire in November.
